      "id": "steering",
      "title": "Steering & front end",
      "subtitle": "Wheel guidance and front-corner components",
      "designTitle": "Coordinated wheel geometry",
      "design": "The steering layout uses Ackermann geometry to coordinate the inside and outside front wheels. The knuckle and stub arm support wheel alignment and transmit front-corner loads.",
