          "label": "Ackermann Kinematic Angle Match",
          "symbol": "\\delta_o",
          "equation_tex": "\\cot(\\delta_o) - \\cot(\\delta_i) = \\frac{K_f}{L} \\Rightarrow \\cot(21.32^\\circ) - \\cot(32.19^\\circ) = 0.974",
